{
  "$comment": [
    "Shared test vectors for booked-elsewhere, Scope §3.4 (the 14.07.2026 decision).",
    "The contract between packages/domain/src/overlap.ts and the SQL",
    "booked_elsewhere_conflict(). Both must return the same verdict for every",
    "case here. Owned by the `scheduling` bot.",
    "",
    "Only the worker's other CONFIRMED bookings are ever fed in; an invitation",
    "they have not accepted never excludes them, so there are no invited cases.",
    "",
    "Times are UTC ISO-8601 without a zone suffix, read as instants. The rule is",
    "pure arithmetic on two windows, so the zone only has to be consistent.",
    "",
    "supabase/tests/_shared/overlap_vectors.psql is GENERATED from this file by",
    "supabase/tests/_shared/overlap-vectors.mjs. Re-run it after any edit:",
    "  node supabase/tests/_shared/overlap-vectors.mjs",
    "The Vitest suite fails if the generated file has drifted."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "Different venues, a clear four-hour gap",
      "candidate": {
        "startsAt": "2026-11-02T18:00",
        "endsAt": "2026-11-02T23:00",
        "venueId": "v2"
      },
      "held": {
        "startsAt": "2026-11-02T09:00",
        "endsAt": "2026-11-02T14:00",
        "venueId": "v1"
      },
      "gapMinutes": 120,
      "expect": "clear"
    },
    {
      "name": "Different venues, exactly two hours — the minimum is inclusive",
      "candidate": {
        "startsAt": "2026-11-02T16:00",
        "endsAt": "2026-11-02T21:00",
        "venueId": "v2"
      },
      "held": {
        "startsAt": "2026-11-02T09:00",
        "endsAt": "2026-11-02T14:00",
        "venueId": "v1"
      },
      "gapMinutes": 120,
      "expect": "clear"
    },
    {
      "name": "Different venues, one minute under two hours",
      "candidate": {
        "startsAt": "2026-11-02T15:59",
        "endsAt": "2026-11-02T21:00",
        "venueId": "v2"
      },
      "held": {
        "startsAt": "2026-11-02T09:00",
